A street artist’s first drop, sold only at END. Soho. The tag in each tee turned a collector into a contact.

100 garments, 75 verified entrants, zero duplicates. 49.3% opted into marketing: a usable list from a first drop. 75 unique Instagram handles, every one a real person. Fraud check clean across phone, email and handle.
